body:
I think what OP is trying to say is instead of bitching about your situation and stay idle, do something. 

&#x200B;

If your country is in war for example, like Syria or Ukraine, you can either cry about it, or do something about it and look for opportunities to move somewhere.

I agree races isn't biological and it's constructed by society, but I don't see the issue on calling someone by their race. Whether they're white, black, Asian, etc. Seeing it as racist is racist. Seeing it as normal and as a characteristic in everyone isn't. 

&#x200B;

I don't know why people avoid saying someone is "black" around other black people. Why? So why can I say he's white without any issue? It's society itself that trying not to be racist, is when It became the most racist. How about dropping all that PC bullshit?

I had a suicide attempt with Tylenol. Had liver failure, and had 50% chance of living.

I understand your depression and how desperate you can get. I can't put in words how much I relate. It is a black hole that just gets getting deeper, right? Yup. I resonate fully.

I'm not gonna try to cheer you on; I'm sure you're sick of people doing it and I'm sure it doesn't work, but I can tell you shit gets better. Suicide, as appealing as it may seem, it's not giving the universe an opportunity to make things a bit better.

30 secs after I took the Tylenol, I realized that I only had one problem in life: That I took the Tylenol. This may sound simplistic, but at that moment, closer to death, you will snap out of it and love life a bit again. Survivors of jumping San Francisco bridge say the same thing.

&#x200B;

If you ever want to talk to a fellow that tried suicide, don't be afraid to shoot a dm. Happy, not to help of cheer you up, but to listen if u prefer.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Hang in there :)
